infinite-patch 1
# Moves with the music: the shape grows with the sound
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 1056
end
node 2 Synths Analog
  id synth
  pos 480 1202
  f volume 0.5
end
node 3 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 1340 1056
end
node 4 Modulators Audio Analyze
  id hear
  pos 0 2546
end
node 5 Source Shape
  id shape
  pos 0 340
  c fillColor 1 0.45 0.3
end
node 6 Effects bloom
  id glow
  pos 460 302
end
node 7 Utility Output
  id out
  pos 920 156
end
node 8 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text A picture that moves with the music.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 9 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 900
  s text The sound. Notes, synth, speakers.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 10 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 2362
  s text Audio Analyze listens to the sound and turns it into moving numbers (level, low, mid, high). Try a different output as the source.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
node 11 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 156
  s text The orange dots on Size X and Size Y means it is driven by the music. Change its Depth to make it move more or less.
  f width 300
  f height 148
end
node 12 Compositing Comment
  pos 460 156
  s text Bloom adds a glow to bright parts. Try raising Intensity.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
node 13 Compositing Comment
  pos 480 1056
  s text This synth is the sound that the picture follows.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
aud hear 0 synth
cable glow 0 shape
cable out 0 glow
mod shape sizeX hear 0 0 1 0.5 0.12 0.4
mod shape sizeY hear 0 0 1 0.5 0.12 0.4
